Z||000011||fiero56||07-21-2001||03:17 PM||||Just today I saw a sweet mint condition black '85GT t-top in a backwoods type of car-lot(I don't know what the place was, lots of POS cars there, was there removing parts from previously totalled car) that had a 3rd brake light 'glassed into the decklid on the most vertical part just above the lock cylinder. Looked professional, and looked very good. t-tops on that car looked brand new, no wear whatsover on them. The car had 30 day tags, and they weren't expired yet, so maybe it was an emplyees??? I liked that 3rd brake-light though. The guys working there were definitely "a few fries short of a happy meal". "A celica? Whats that?"||||reg||1
