Z||000013||johnt671||07-21-2001||05:56 PM||||Since I found this site I've installed on my 84 SE an MSD 8226 coil, MSD 6A ignition control system, Accel 8mm wires, drilled out my air intake, K&N air filter, followed Archie's clutch bleeding method, went to mobil 1 in the trans, and Valvoline syn brake fluid in the clutch and installed a short shifter.  Further plans may include a Darrel Morse rebuild on the throttle body and a replacement for the exaust system.  Car is more fun then ever.||||reg||1
