Z||000022||AkursedX||07-22-2001||01:15 AM||||here's the list of mods:<P>Brake and suspension:<BR>Stainless Steel brakelines<BR>Carbon Metallic pads<BR>KYB shocks and struts. (monotube in front, GR2's in the rear)<BR>Fierostore lowering springs.<BR>Polyurethane bushings and endlinks.  <P>Tires and Rims:<BR>Konig Tantrums. (17x7 in the front, 17x8 in the rear.)<BR>Kuhmo Ecsta Supra 712's (215/45-17 in front, 235/45-17 in the rear)<P>Engine:<BR>Stainless steel valves<BR>ported heads, and lower and intermediate intakes<BR>Compcams 1.52 roller rockers<BR>K&N air filter<P>Interior:<BR>Kenwood 4" component speakers in the front<BR>Blaupunkt 4x6's in the rear.<BR>Panasonic's best head unit.  (I can't remember the model # but it lists for $450 in Crutchfield  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> )<BR>Boss 200x2 amp bridged into one 10" Pioneer Premier Dual Voice Coil sub in a custom footwell box made by Stimpy<P>I think that's all of it....so far  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
