Z||000029||Black88GT||07-22-2001||04:14 PM||||Hmm....<P><u>Engine/Ignition</u><P>- 3.4 from '95 Firebird<BR>- J. Wynman chip (no EGR, low temp thermostat) <BR>- 24# Accel injectors<BR>- Holley Adj. fuel pressure regulator<BR>- Low temp fan switch/thermostat (180)<BR>- Ported throttle body/plenums <BR>- MSD-6AL with blaster coil <BR>- Accel 8.8 mm wires<BR>- ASP pulley set (not just crank)<P><u>Intake/Exhaust</u><P>- Borla exhaust<BR>- 304 straight pipe (r. dickman)<BR>- West coast fiero intake (soon)<BR>- West coast fiero headers (soon)<P><u>Brakes/Suspension</u><P>- Earls SS brake lines<BR>- Carbomet pads<BR>- Eibach springs<BR>- KYB shocks (white) and struts<BR>- Poly sway bar bushings (f/r)<P><u>Interior/Stereo</u><P>- Fiero Store floor mats (black)<BR>- Short shifter with leather boot<BR>- Sony MP3 headunit <BR>- AusFiero's door pod speakers (will use Sony Xplod components) <BR>- Sony Xplod 40x4 + 150x1 amp<BR>- Sony Xplod 60x4 amp w/built in Eq.<BR>- Infinity Kappa 4x6 plates (rear)<BR>- MTX 10" sub in footwell fiberglass box (will soon upgrade to Sony Xplod DVC)<BR>- 2 pairs of 3 1/2" Infinity Kappas up front with 5 1/4" &lt;undecided&gt; speakers in the middle (soon)<P>The stereo speakers havent been installed yet, I have most of them but I waiting for AusFiero's door pods so I can just spend a day on them all.  Right now I just have Pioneer 4x10s and stock 4x6s (yuck).<P>I still need paint and rims but I would do performance/suspension first (aka anti-rice mentality)<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff (AOL IM - FieroTT)<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD - MAFOA<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://88database.homestead.com/files/AF.gif">     <BR><I>"Once you go black, you never go back..."</I><BR><I>"The Customer Can Have Any Color He Wants So Long As It's Black" </I> -Henry Ford||||reg||7
